	(text_box "This schematic defines the electronics for a multi-sensor rover platform, including power regulation, motor control, ultrasonic ranging, wheel encoding, and RC input. A multiplexed ultrasonic array, dual motor drivers, battery monitoring, and an MSPM0 MCU work together to provide sensing, control, and system management across the rover."
